## COMPREHENSIVE SCENARIO MATRIX

### Image Workflows

| User Intent | Needed Agents | Dependency Graph | Execution |
|-------------|---------------|------------------|-----------|
| **"Add this"** (unknown product) | V, P, C | V→{P,C} | Wave 1: V → Wave 2: P‖C |
| **"Add our X variants"** (known) | V, C | V→C | Wave 1: V → Wave 2: C |
| **"Update product X's image"** | C, V, Creative, CS | C→V→Creative→CS | Wave 1: C → 2: V → 3: Creative → 4: CS |
| **"Is this already in catalog?"** | C, V | C→(V if needed) | Wave 1: C, decide if V needed |
| **"Process image for catalog"** | V, Creative, CS | V→Creative→CS | Wave 1: V → 2: Creative → 3: CS |
| **"Just remove background"** | Creative | (none if path known) | Wave 1: Creative |
| **"Research this product"** | V, P | V→P | Wave 1: V → Wave 2: P |
| **"Create variants: red/blue"** | V, Creative (N times) | V→Creative1,Creative2 | Wave 1: V → 2: Creative (parallel if multi-item protocol loaded) |

### Text-Only Workflows

| User Intent | Needed Agents | Dependency Graph | Execution |
|-------------|---------------|------------------|-----------|
| **"What families exist?"** | C | (none) | Wave 1: C |
| **"Market price for jars?"** | P | (none) | Wave 1: P |
| **"Compare our vs market prices"** | P, C | (independent) | Wave 1: P‖C |
| **"Update X to price Y"** | C, CS | C→CS | Wave 1: C → 2: CS |
| **"Create price graphic for X"** | C, Creative | C→Creative | Wave 1: C → 2: Creative |
| **"Delete old Premium variant"** | C, CS | C→(verify)→CS | Wave 1: C → ask user → 2: CS |
| **"How many in Bottles family?"** | C | (none) | Wave 1: C |

### Mixed Context Workflows

| User Intent | Needed Agents | Dependency Graph | Execution |
|-------------|---------------|------------------|-----------|
| **"Add this + research market"** | V, P, C | V→{P,C} | Wave 1: V → Wave 2: P‖C |
| **"Update pricing for [image]"** | V, C, CS | V→C→CS | Wave 1: V → 2: C → 3: CS |
| **"Compare this to our X"** | C, V | C→V (need to know what X is first) | Wave 1: C → 2: V |
| **"Add to family Y"** | C (verify Y), V, CS | C→V→CS | Wave 1: C → 2: V → 3: CS |
| **Image + "check if duplicate"** | V, C | V→C | Wave 1: V → 2: C |

### Multi-Image Workflows

| User Intent | Needed Agents | Dependency Graph | Execution |
|-------------|---------------|------------------|-----------|
| **[N images] + "add all"** | V | V (determine relationship) | Wave 1: V (multi-image analysis) |
| **"Bodies in A, lids in B"** | V, Creative | V→Creative (composition) | Wave 1: V → 2: Creative |
| **"Compare option 1 vs 2"** | V | V (comparison) | Wave 1: V |
| **"Use A style on B,C,D"** | V, Creative (N times) | V→Creative1,2,3 | Wave 1: V → 2: Creative (parallel) |

